        "content": "<p>Destructor17 opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14496\">issue #14496</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h3>Test Case</h3>\n<p>Sorry for not attaching .wasm, but it's efficiently just a WASIp3 component working with files.</p>\n<h3>Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Build a <code>WasiCtx</code> with a preopened directory</li>\n<li>Run a WASIp3 component that calls <code>stat-at</code> and/or <code>open-at</code> under that <code>WasiCtx</code> </li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Results</h3>\n<p><code>stat-at</code> and <code>open-at</code> imports should work normally, ...</p>\n<h3>Actual Results</h3>\n<p>...but a crash occurs. Logcat says something like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Fatal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">signal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">31</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SIGSYS</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SYS_SECCOMP</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rustix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">backend</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">syscalls</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">openat2</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">openat2</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">hc1f3ac4ec71728ad</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">116</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rustix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">backend</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">syscalls</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">openat2</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h5222c9c58f8fcf06</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">208</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rustix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">openat2</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">openat2</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$u7b$$u7b$closure$u7d$$u7d$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h83c78ed66dc0812b</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">76</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$LT$$RF$core</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">c_str</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">CStr</span><span class=\"cp\">$u20$as$u20$rustix</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">arg</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">Arg</span><span class=\"cp\">$GT$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">into_with_c_str</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h4db8c88098b30335</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">68</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rustix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fs</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">openat2</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">openat2</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">hfb603d5b70894bb0</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">88</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_wasi</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">filesystem</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">primitives</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">unix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">linux</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">open_beneath</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$u7b$$u7b$closure$u7d$$u7d$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h5e16d76408a22a9a</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">156</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rustix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">arg</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">with_c_str</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h841ab7fbe2e1bcc2</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">480</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$LT$$RF$$u5b$u8$u5d$$u20$as$u20$rustix</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">arg</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">Arg</span><span class=\"cp\">$GT$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">into_with_c_str</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h9d4a420ef77ceb1e</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">48</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$LT$$RF$std</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">ffi</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">os_str</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">OsStr</span><span class=\"cp\">$u20$as$u20$rustix</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">arg</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">Arg</span><span class=\"cp\">$GT$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">into_with_c_str</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">hec859fd86b77e30a</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">56</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$LT$$RF$std</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"cp\">$u20$as$u20$rustix</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">arg</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"n\">Arg</span><span class=\"cp\">$GT$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">into_with_c_str</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h8ea8ca228b36edcd</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">56</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_wasi</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">filesystem</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">primitives</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">unix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">linux</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">open_beneath</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h846ec95dba65d4fc</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">356</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_wasi</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">filesystem</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">primitives</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">unix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">linux</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stat_fast</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h8d1b89fa051f7368</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">148</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_wasi</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">filesystem</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">primitives</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stat</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h591c4288cf4c570a</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">120</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_wasi</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">filesystem</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">unix</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stat_at</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">he57e8f946104f5f2</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">52</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime_wasi</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">filesystem</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Dir</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stat_at</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$u7b$$u7b$closure$u7d$$u7d$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"cp\">$u7b$$u7b$closure$u7d$$u7d$</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">h7a9f96a1378b6b63</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">68</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>and the same for <code>open-at</code> case, down to <code>wasmtime_wasi::filesystem::primitives::unix::linux::open_beneath</code></p>\n<h3>Versions and Environment</h3>\n<p>Wasmtime version or commit: <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/commit/11eac9de8693e1a69f86815d1a58918edd5c1785\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/commit/11eac9de8693e1a69f86815d1a58918edd5c1785</a>, a recent version</p>\n<p>Operating system: Android 13</p>\n<p>Architecture: arm64-v8a</p>\n<h3>Extra Info</h3>\n<p>Fixed it locally by simply skipping calls to <code>stat_fast</code> and <code>open_fast</code> on Android, since they both have fallback implementations.</p>\n<p>My other, less successful attempts to fix:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>updated <code>rustix</code> to <code>1.1.5</code>, but it gives the same result</li>\n<li>added <code>RUSTFLAGS=\"--cfg=rustix_no_linux_raw --cfg=rustix_use_libc\"</code>, but it causes <code>unresolved import rustix::fs::openat2</code> error</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/3521`\">old PR</a> mentions the same symptoms</p>\n</blockquote>",
